    log:[['tool','policy_train(damp3, continue_from=baseline, randomize={}, disturbance=0) → <span class="r">2.9 min</span>'], ['say','96% in the damped sim (baseline was 0% there). Margin over the 3.5 threshold is thin though: let me check how it holds up if the true damping is a bit off my estimate.'], ['tool','sim_set_params({valve_damping_scale: 3.4}) · sim_eval_policy(damp3, n=15) → <span class="r">93%</span>'], ['say','Holds at 93% even at ×3.4, so it\'s not knife-edge. Restoring my best estimate and deploying.']],
