    log:[['tool','submit_diagnosis(iteration 2)'], ['say','<b>Confirmed by intervention, not by fit</b>: the hinge\'s viscous damping is ~3× higher on the real robot than in the nominal simulator. Setting valve_damping_scale = 3.0 and continuing training from the baseline with nothing else changed took the real robot from 0/10 to 7/7. This is the standard of proof the task asks for.'], ['say','A small residual: with the new policy the real robot is uniformly ~5% slower than my simulator from the same starts, so the true damping is nearer 3.15 than 3.0. Not worth a second training.']],
