    log:[['tool','real_deploy(grip04, n=8) → <span class="r">4/8</span>'], ['say','50% now (from 10%): <b>the pick is fixed</b>; every remaining failure is a <b>drop after the pick</b>, with the box rotating 65–89° in the gripper vs 36–58° in the paired sim. Let me probe the in-hand slip directly.']],
