    log:[['tool', 'real_deploy(align5, n=5) → <span class="r">3/5</span> · read evidence_04/summary.md · strip_ep0112.png · ee_paths.png'], ['say', 'Real: 3/5, but <b>every first attempt jammed in this batch, and the retries often re-jam</b>. Looking at the keyframes to understand the jam geometry.'], ['tool', 'submit_diagnosis(iteration 4)'], ['say', 'Relative to grip friction the cube pivots in the parallel grasp when its bottom edge contacts the socket rim during the pressed descent, wedging tilted in the 6 mm/side clearance: <b>jam at cube z ≈ 36–38 mm vs seated 25 mm</b>. The real stalled TCP is pushed +9 mm in y at every descent (sim +3 mm): larger contact forces.']],
